id: time-power-dominion-over-time
name: Dominion Over Time
order: 4
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
# (1) Exhausting and Draining lost.
aspects: -Exhausting, -Draining
description: >
  Your mastery over the flow of time is so great that you can command it with merely a thought.
text: >
  Dominion Over Time: Your mastery over the flow of time is so great that you can command it with merely a thought.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Time Power loses the Exhausting and Draining Aspects.
  (2)-[Passive]: Reduce the Ki Point Cost of any Unique Ability with 'Time' in their name by 2(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: The 3rd effect of Time Control loses the [1/Encounter] Keyword and gains the [1/Round, 2/Encounter] Keywords.
  (4)-[Passive]: Ignore the 4th effect of Time Control.

---

# (3) Time Control (3)'s Keywords: the table's, as Time Control (3) is.

# (4) Time Control (4) ignored.
[passive, effect 4]
allow timeControl.noDrain;

# (2) The Unique Abilities with 'Time' in their name 2(T) cheaper - Time Freeze (Time Seal and Time Reversion not built).
[passive, effect 2]
time-freeze.kiCost -= 2(T);
